<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH OPATOVICE POWER SAYS PROFIT DIPS-CTK.</title>
<headline>CZECH OPATOVICE POWER SAYS PROFIT DIPS-CTK.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech power producer Elektrarne Opatovice said on Tuesday its 1996 net profit fell to 520 million crowns from 535 million crowns the previous year, the CTK news agency reported.</p>
<p>It said the lower profit was due to the lower purchase price paid by clients. No further details were avaialble.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
